# AutoRin

Marketplace for **selling automobile parts, accessories, and related technical goods** (ehtiyot qismlar, aksessuarlar, sarf materiallari). Not a generic SaaS or booking app.

Stack in this repo: `autorin-web` (admin / auth web), `autorin-backend`, `my_auto` (mobile).

Copy, imagery, empty states, and examples must stay auto-parts specific: brands, models, spare parts, suppliers, orders, moderation of listings.

i18n: uz / ru / en. Store each string as an object, not a JSON i18n tree:

```ts
title: { uz: "...", ru: "...", en: "..." }
```
